{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791914940, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T18:09:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T18:10:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791915000, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T18:09:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44200, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "為什麼臺北市到處都在砍樹？市府提出的理由有些根本站不住腳，市民該如何反制？", "display_name": "大安代表 No.44,200", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T18:09:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17273, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "路上的垃圾筒都被收光光，害路邊多了很多找不到地方丟的垃圾", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,273", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T18:09:21+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12445, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "倒垃圾還要看時間，沒有彈性，非常不方便。這體制已經很多年了，有更好的方法或科技嗎", "display_name": "大同代表 No.12,445", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T18:09:33+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14741, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "道路上的路燈、號誌桿、架過多，影響美觀，是不是可以整合，簡化及統一樣式，剔除不必要的部分，讓市容美麗", "display_name": "北投代表 No.14,741", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T18:09:48+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56019, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當擔任市長，（純舊制）勞工退休金未依據勞基法辦理！\n勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.56,019", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 17273, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,273", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 12445, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.12,445", "district": "datong",